{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2021-03-09 09:01:00', 'title': 'CORITY TO COLLABORATE WITH 3M TO ACCELERATE THE FUTURE OF CONNECTED EHS MANAGEMENT AND WORKER SAFETY', 'text': "TORONTO, MARCH 09, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CORITY, THE GLOBAL ENTERPRISE ENVIRONMENTAL, HEALTH, AND SAFETY (EHS) SOFTWARE PROVIDER, TODAY ANNOUNCED A COLLABORATION WITH 3M'S PERSONAL SAFETY DIVISION IN THE AREA OF CONNECTED SAFETY TECHNOLOGIES."}